{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e08-scene-02",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "全团队退出文娱论  (Handing Over Entertainment Talk)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "kaiwen": "凯文",
    "xingzi": "杏子"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Welcome to Episode 8 of Behind the Scenes. At a meeting with network executives, Kaiwen and Xingzi announce Chun Yuqiao's decision to hand Entertainment Talk over to Unit Two while asking for patience on Twelve Singers until he recovers. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "淳于总交代过了，他不习惯联合制作。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "所以新版的文娱论，他不准备署名。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我们老大说了，所有节目都放在制作一部是不合理的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "制作二部在改版期间得到了充分的锻炼。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "完全有能力单独掌握好新版文娱论的制作。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "整个文娱论项目，我们已经做好了准备完全交给二部。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我们制作一部全团队退出。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "那天晚上喝酒之前他就交代过了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "以淳于总现在的身体状况，我觉得急不得吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "其实我们起草方案已经有一段时间了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "只不过有很多比较重要的细节，必须得等淳于总回来之后再做决定。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "淳于总交代过了，他不习惯联合制作。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr Chun Yuqiao left instructions that he is not accustomed to co-producing.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "所以新版的文娱论，他不准备署名。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'So on the revamped Entertainment Talk, he does not plan to put his name in the credits.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我们老大说了，所有节目都放在制作一部是不合理的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Our boss said placing every single show under Production Unit One is unreasonable.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "制作二部在改版期间得到了充分的锻炼。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Production Unit Two gained thorough hands-on training during the revamp.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "完全有能力单独掌握好新版文娱论的制作。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'They are fully capable of handling production of the revamped Entertainment Talk on their own.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "整个文娱论项目，我们已经做好了准备完全交给二部。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We are ready to hand the entire Entertainment Talk project over completely to Unit Two.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我们制作一部全团队退出。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Our entire Production Unit One team is stepping back from it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "那天晚上喝酒之前他就交代过了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He already gave those instructions before the dinner drinks that night.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "以淳于总现在的身体状况，我觉得急不得吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Given Mr Chun Yuqiao's current health condition, I do not think we can rush this.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "其实我们起草方案已经有一段时间了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'In fact, we have been drafting the proposal for quite a while now.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "只不过有很多比较重要的细节，必须得等淳于总回来之后再做决定。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Only there are many important details that must wait until Mr Chun Yuqiao returns to decide.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "淳于总交代过了，他不习惯联合制作。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "所以新版的文娱论，他不准备署名。",
      "gap": 0.5
