    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "以淳于总现在的身体状况，我觉得急不得吧。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "其实我们起草方案已经有一段时间了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "只不过有很多比较重要的细节，必须得等淳于总回来之后再做决定。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "By cleanly handing Entertainment Talk to Unit Two, Unit One buys a few precious days to prepare Twelve Singers while Chun Yuqiao rests. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "回头见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
